  "id": "build-a-bear-workshop",
  "name": "Build-A-Bear Workshop",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Cards with the Build-A-Bear Workshop logo on the picture, given to buyers of its Pokémon bears, in its shops or online. Eevee went to buyers of the Eevee bear from 1 September 2016 and Jigglypuff to buyers of the Jigglypuff bear from 31 May 2018; the other copies, from Bulbasaur, Squirtle and Charmander to Pikachu, Snorlax and Piplup, carry the same logo.",
